        "Notes": "For a comment on this Academy, how it was formed, the reasons why it was dismantled, and the list of members, see Michele Maylender, Storia delle Accademie d`Italia, ad vocem. Maylender indicates that manuscript minutes of the meetings can be found in ms 1459 of the Biblioteca Comunale di Verona. See also Corrado Pecorella, `Note per la classificazione della Accademie italiane dei secoli XVI e XVIII`, in Studi Sassaresi, 1, serie 3, pp. 206-231, for a short comment on the activities taking place in the Academy.",
